{
  "schema": 1,
  "about": "The Rust stack's pinned toolchain archives (manifest.ts reads them as RUST_MANIFEST). Every URL is a durable release URL on its component's release host (RELEASE_URL_PREFIXES); each sha256 is the one scripts/spike/rust-wgpu/pins.md records from the official source's published checksum, each size the downloaded archive's (darwin-arm64) or the release host's Content-Length (linux-x64, 2026-10-06). The crate checker (cargo-deny, cargo-vet and the RustSec snapshot `crate-policy.json` pins; `scripts/toolchains/crate-policy.ts refresh` moves the snapshot) installs on demand at the person's first crate approval and is in no build lock. The vendored crate set (rust-vendor) joins once the owner publishes a `genex` release cut by `scripts/toolchains/rust-release.ts cut` and `rust-release.ts pin` adds it.",
